# ===== NEW: Secure Config System =====
# Bootstrap config tracked di git (no secrets per design Secreton — semua
# sensitive config encrypted di storage backend, lihat header secreton.toml).
# Dockerfile COPY file ini ke /app/config/secreton.toml saat build.
# /secreton.toml  # <- DULU di-ignore; sekarang tracked.

# Safe to commit: example config with no secrets
!/secreton.toml.example

